	(text "Banks 3 and 4 run at 3.3 V (pins GPIO4_C2-C6 at 1.8 V, GPIO4_D0-D5 on the SD supply: unused).\nPCIe reset and clock-request lines sit on each controller's own M1 pins. Assignments are in GPIO_USE\nin build.py; those marked 'this board' are new and not from the reference."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
